{"title":"Yokohama Kaidashi Kikou","overview":"Set hundreds of years in the future after an environmental catastrophe, Yokohama Kaidashi Kikou (also known as Yokohama Shopping Log) centers on the simple life of Alpha, an android who runs a small coffee shop in coastal Japan. Alpha stands witness to chronicle the end of humanity’s days with coffee, a slice of watermelon, and the sound of her moon guitar backed by distant seagulls. Quiet and bittersweet, this tale is about the melancholy beauty that can be found even as the end approaches. \n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment) \n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*","year":1994,"status":"ended","genres":["Adventure","Award Winning","Mystery","Sci-Fi","Seinen","Slice of Life","Supernatural"],"rating":8.6,"seriesType":"manga","metadata":{"images":[{"coverType":"poster","url":"/demo/MediaCover/20b61f2e-a78d-877e-9ee3-fe4427c051b6/poster-6c356f643b.jpg","remoteUrl":"https://images.mangabaka.dev/8/b/b/5/4/0/5/5/c8ee/41f8/b455/1a177f4aaed2"}],"creators":[{"name":"Hitoshi Ashinano","roles":["storyAndArt"]}],"externalLinks":[{"name":"MangaBaka","externalId":"10756","url":"https://mangabaka.org/manga/10756/Yokohama-Kaidashi-Kikou","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Grand Comics Database","externalId":"170187","url":"https://www.comics.org/series/170187/","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Grand Comics Database","externalId":"189911","url":"https://www.comics.org/series/189911/","relationshipType":1},{"name":"AniList","externalId":"30004","url":"https://anilist.co/manga/30004","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Comic DAYS","externalId":"13932016480030383979","url":"https://comic-days.com/episode/13932016480030383979","relationshipType":0},{"name":"Wikipedia EN","externalId":"Yokohama_Kaidashi_Kikō","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yokohama_Kaidashi_Kik%C5%8D","relationshipType":0},{"name":"Wikipedia","externalId":"ヨコハマ買い出し紀行","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%A8%E3%82%B3%E3%83%8F%E3%83%9E%E8%B2%B7%E3%81%84%E5%87%BA%E3%81%